(6648723, 992605, 142473, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites from this challenge.  This is what I would have captured if I had the geography around me, you are blessed to live in such a place!</td>', 'One of my favorites from this challenge.  This is what I would have captured if I had the geography around me, you are blessed to live in such a place!', '2012-01-18 14:02:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6648726, 992656, 142473, '<td valign="top">Thumbnail doesn''t do this photo justice.  Excellent shot.  I hope this one ribbons.</td>', 'Thumbnail doesn''t do this photo justice.  Excellent shot.  I hope this one ribbons.', '2012-01-18 14:03:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6648731, 993414, 142473, '<td valign="top">Great composition and subject.<br/> <br/>Two possible improvements in my eyes:<br/>Venus (I assume) could have been composed to the right of the tree, and might have come out stronger (maybe!).<br/> <br/>Some de-noise in the sky could be good too.  Stars are hard because you want them to expose, but you don''t want noise.  I struggle with this a lot myself.  The most amazing sky images have stars that pop from a smooth background.<br/> <br/>Don''t get me wrong, I hope this ribbons!</td>', 'Great composition and subject. Two possible improvements in my eyes:Venus (I assume) could have been composed to the right of the tree, and might have come out stronger (maybe!). Some de-noise in the sky could be good too.  Stars are hard because you want them to expose, but you don''t want noise.  I struggle with this a lot myself.  The most amazing sky images have stars that pop from a smooth background. Don''t get me wrong, I hope this ribbons!', '2012-01-18 14:06:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6648736, 993395, 142473, '<td valign="top">Improvement to the composition would be to crop out the lower half of the image.  The foreground really splits this image in half, and the eye doesn''t know where to go.</td>', 'Improvement to the composition would be to crop out the lower half of the image.  The foreground really splits this image in half, and the eye doesn''t know where to go.', '2012-01-18 14:16:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6648738, 992610, 142473, '<td valign="top">The foreground light kinda ruined this one for me.  The camera focused on the closest object and therefore de-focused the sky, which is what I think you really wanted to focus on here.  Good effort though.</td>', 'The foreground light kinda ruined this one for me.  The camera focused on the closest object and therefore de-focused the sky, which is what I think you really wanted to focus on here.  Good effort though.', '2012-01-18 14:18:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6648739, 993415, 142473, '<td valign="top">The composition here is a bit off.  The tree is nice, but the way it''s cropped, the tree doesn''t feel like the subject.  The fence (dark band) feels like the subject, but I think that''s just due to the crop.<br/> <br/>A little sharpening could have helped this image too.</td>', 'The composition here is a bit off.  The tree is nice, but the way it''s cropped, the tree doesn''t feel like the subject.  The fence (dark band) feels like the subject, but I think that''s just due to the crop. A little sharpening could have helped this image too.', '2012-01-18 14:20:39.000000', NULL, 1),
