(6649679, 993463, 63244, '<td valign="top">Very pretty and beautiful colors, but very small. You are able to utilize up to 800 pixels per side, so take advantage! :) The file size will go down once you save it for web.</td>', 'Very pretty and beautiful colors, but very small. You are able to utilize up to 800 pixels per side, so take advantage! :) The file size will go down once you save it for web.', '2012-01-19 15:07:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6649681, 992624, 63244, '<td valign="top">Great perspective and I love the dark mood of the photograph! Looks almost gothic (with the exception of the cars, lol). Nicely done!</td>', 'Great perspective and I love the dark mood of the photograph! Looks almost gothic (with the exception of the cars, lol). Nicely done!', '2012-01-19 15:08:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6649684, 993428, 63244, '<td valign="top">Decrease your shutter speed!  :)  I like the way the trees lead you down the path. I fear this will do poorly, but I appreciate your entry!!!!</td>', 'Decrease your shutter speed!  :)  I like the way the trees lead you down the path. I fear this will do poorly, but I appreciate your entry!!!!', '2012-01-19 15:11:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6649686, 993306, 63244, '<td valign="top">Love the perspective and the cold Winter colors!</td>', 'Love the perspective and the cold Winter colors!', '2012-01-19 15:11:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6649687, 993418, 63244, '<td valign="top">I could see this hanging on an office wall!</td>', 'I could see this hanging on an office wall!', '2012-01-19 15:12:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6649689, 993260, 63244, '<td valign="top">It''s tilted a bit, but I like the movement and the layers of texture. The piercing light in the lower right adds a cool dimension to the overall color pallet. Good clarity...and the shooting star on the left (or whatever) is just a bonus of the long shutter! Nicely seen!</td>', 'It''s tilted a bit, but I like the movement and the layers of texture. The piercing light in the lower right adds a cool dimension to the overall color pallet. Good clarity...and the shooting star on the left (or whatever) is just a bonus of the long shutter! Nicely seen!', '2012-01-19 15:14:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6649693, 993344, 63244, '<td valign="top">This is very calming. It give you the feeling of cold and isolation. Great composition!</td>', 'This is very calming. It give you the feeling of cold and isolation. Great composition!', '2012-01-19 15:21:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6649719, 993378, 63244, '<td valign="top">This has an old world masters feel to it. I like how the tree leans toward the beautiful island treasure in the lower left. It might have been even more dramatic had you waited 5-10 more minutes to shoot, then done the shot. IMHO, it could benefit from a crop of the top so you are into the dark branches on the left, making the inner edge of the tree on the line just past the rule of thirds or so the tree edge is in the top middle. I don''t care for the thin black edge I am seeing This would make an interesting oil painting.</td>', 'This has an old world masters feel to it. I like how the tree leans toward the beautiful island treasure in the lower left. It might have been even more dramatic had you waited 5-10 more minutes to shoot, then done the shot. IMHO, it could benefit from a crop of the top so you are into the dark branches on the left, making the inner edge of the tree on the line just past the rule of thirds or so the tree edge is in the top middle. I don''t care for the thin black edge I am seeing This would make an interesting oil painting.', '2012-01-19 16:35:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6649721, 992711, 63244, '<td valign="top">Love the electric (pun intended) feel of the shot and the bright, bright colors. Simple and modern shot. Nice!</td>', 'Love the electric (pun intended) feel of the shot and the bright, bright colors. Simple and modern shot. Nice!', '2012-01-19 16:36:20.000000', NULL, 1);
