(6649756, 993421, 12611, '<td valign="top">really like this. Evokes the feel of the Movie "the village" or perhaps the Neil Gaiman story "Stardust." Anyway, moody terrific feel.</td>', 'really like this. Evokes the feel of the Movie "the village" or perhaps the Neil Gaiman story "Stardust." Anyway, moody terrific feel.', '2012-01-19 17:47:26.000000', NULL, 1),
