(6649975, 993367, 10785, '<td valign="top">Light is great! Sharpness needs work. (My guess is either camera shake either from no use of shutter lock or the traffic causing vibrations picked up by your tripod.)</td>', 'Light is great! Sharpness needs work. (My guess is either camera shake either from no use of shutter lock or the traffic causing vibrations picked up by your tripod.)', '2012-01-19 22:21:19.000000', NULL, 1),
