(6650656, 993424, 142815, '<td valign="top">This is such great lighting. The tree looks fantastic. Nice work.</td>', 'This is such great lighting. The tree looks fantastic. Nice work.', '2012-01-20 14:30:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6650694, 993357, 133853, '<td valign="top">Great stars...  good job!</td>', 'Great stars...  good job!', '2012-01-20 15:10:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6650703, 993392, 142473, '<td valign="top">Strong sky composition.  Clearly the subject is the sky, and the ground makes a nice frame for it.  Nice job getting crisp stars, and minimal noise in the background.</td>', 'Strong sky composition.  Clearly the subject is the sky, and the ground makes a nice frame for it.  Nice job getting crisp stars, and minimal noise in the background.', '2012-01-20 15:13:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6650709, 993422, 142473, '<td valign="top">Very interesting shot.  The brown water tells a story in itself.  Well executed.</td>', 'Very interesting shot.  The brown water tells a story in itself.  Well executed.', '2012-01-20 15:15:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6650712, 992714, 142473, '<td valign="top">I like this shot.  Could have been slightly stronger by getting a little closer to the ground and placing the rocks off-center. 8</td>', 'I like this shot.  Could have been slightly stronger by getting a little closer to the ground and placing the rocks off-center. 8', '2012-01-20 15:16:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6650717, 993457, 142473, '<td valign="top">The colors of this image keep me coming back.  Nice crisp buildings, blurred sky.  Very nice long exposure!</td>', 'The colors of this image keep me coming back.  Nice crisp buildings, blurred sky.  Very nice long exposure!', '2012-01-20 15:17:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6650724, 993341, 142473, '<td valign="top">Something soothing about this image.  My only complaint is that I think there''s a bit too much foreground in the bottom right.<br/> <br/>I find it interesting that the moon reflection is that of a short exposure, but the sky is that of a long exposure.  Pretty interesting effect.</td>', 'Something soothing about this image.  My only complaint is that I think there''s a bit too much foreground in the bottom right. I find it interesting that the moon reflection is that of a short exposure, but the sky is that of a long exposure.  Pretty interesting effect.', '2012-01-20 15:20:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6650725, 992759, 142473, '<td valign="top">I really do like this image.  I think it could benefit from a little sharpening though.  To me, it almost looks out of focus... or maybe it''s due to camera shake?  Maybe try weighing down your tripod next time to prevent the little shakes due to wind.</td>', 'I really do like this image.  I think it could benefit from a little sharpening though.  To me, it almost looks out of focus... or maybe it''s due to camera shake?  Maybe try weighing down your tripod next time to prevent the little shakes due to wind.', '2012-01-20 15:20:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6650728, 992846, 142473, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  Photo is a bit grainy, and it appears a tad out of focus.  Might have been nice to crop out the lit building on top of the hill.</td>', 'Nice composition.  Photo is a bit grainy, and it appears a tad out of focus.  Might have been nice to crop out the lit building on top of the hill.', '2012-01-20 15:22:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6650729, 992679, 142473, '<td valign="top">Strong use of colors.  Interesting take on the challenge with a horizon that''s out of focus.  Makes for good "texture".</td>', 'Strong use of colors.  Interesting take on the challenge with a horizon that''s out of focus.  Makes for good "texture".', '2012-01-20 15:23:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6650731, 992690, 142473, '<td valign="top">I think I would have liked this a lot more if it was level.<br/> <br/>Incredible tranquility of the water.</td>', 'I think I would have liked this a lot more if it was level. Incredible tranquility of the water.', '2012-01-20 15:24:33.000000', NULL, 1),
