(6651430, 993260, 119863, '<td valign="top">very nice photo, for some reason the noise is more "enjoyable" than it usually is in other photos.  If you shot RAW and imported to Photoshop, there should be a straightening tool that''ll allow you to rotate very slightly to level the horizon.  I think using the crop tool and rotating it would also work, but it''s a little trickier to do precisely.</td>', 'very nice photo, for some reason the noise is more "enjoyable" than it usually is in other photos.  If you shot RAW and imported to Photoshop, there should be a straightening tool that''ll allow you to rotate very slightly to level the horizon.  I think using the crop tool and rotating it would also work, but it''s a little trickier to do precisely.', '2012-01-21 16:30:07.000000', NULL, 1),
