(6653490, 992985, 35086, '<td valign="top">I''d consider this more of an urban shot than a night shot, even if it was taken at night, since the emphasis is on the city and the weather rather than the night.  Also, I see no landscape.</td>', 'I''d consider this more of an urban shot than a night shot, even if it was taken at night, since the emphasis is on the city and the weather rather than the night.  Also, I see no landscape.', '2012-01-24 01:24:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6653491, 993252, 35086, '<td valign="top">Lovely light trails here, beautiful sky too.  The centered horizon works well too since it seems to balance out the light in the image.</td>', 'Lovely light trails here, beautiful sky too.  The centered horizon works well too since it seems to balance out the light in the image.', '2012-01-24 01:25:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6653492, 993462, 35086, '<td valign="top">I''ve often dreamed of a place like this.  I know there must be tons of places such as this one but I get a weird sense of deja vue looking at it.<br/> <br/>The image is pretty good... it is slightly underexposed, by a stop or more but I still get what you were shooting and if this was intentional, it''s not bad.</td>', 'I''ve often dreamed of a place like this.  I know there must be tons of places such as this one but I get a weird sense of deja vue looking at it. The image is pretty good... it is slightly underexposed, by a stop or more but I still get what you were shooting and if this was intentional, it''s not bad.', '2012-01-24 01:27:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6653494, 993454, 35086, '<td valign="top">Seems the emphasis isn''t on the night but rather on the city/street.  It is a very nice shot and you did seem to capture the night a bit with it but emphasis on night and landscape just isn''t there in my opinion.<br/> <br/>But it is a very nice shot, the B&amp;W was a good choice too.</td>', 'Seems the emphasis isn''t on the night but rather on the city/street.  It is a very nice shot and you did seem to capture the night a bit with it but emphasis on night and landscape just isn''t there in my opinion. But it is a very nice shot, the B&W was a good choice too.', '2012-01-24 01:29:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6653495, 993415, 35086, '<td valign="top">A tad out of focus and underexposed.  Also, it is very grainy which takes much of the appeal away from this kind of shot.  On the plus side, the composition here is decent.</td>', 'A tad out of focus and underexposed.  Also, it is very grainy which takes much of the appeal away from this kind of shot.  On the plus side, the composition here is decent.', '2012-01-24 01:30:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6653496, 993374, 35086, '<td valign="top">Beautiful cityscape at night.  Love the details, the tones and the composition.  That rail serves as a great leading line, drawing the eye right to the heart of the city.  The strong contrast of the snow against the dark backdrop and the entire scene is just very nice.  No distracting elements that I can see, this is top scores here.</td>', 'Beautiful cityscape at night.  Love the details, the tones and the composition.  That rail serves as a great leading line, drawing the eye right to the heart of the city.  The strong contrast of the snow against the dark backdrop and the entire scene is just very nice.  No distracting elements that I can see, this is top scores here.', '2012-01-24 01:33:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6653497, 993424, 35086, '<td valign="top">I really like simple night shots such as this one.  The composition isn''t the strongest with that tree right in the middle and the first house on the right cut in half but it''s not bad either, I guess it feels natural.</td>', 'I really like simple night shots such as this one.  The composition isn''t the strongest with that tree right in the middle and the first house on the right cut in half but it''s not bad either, I guess it feels natural.', '2012-01-24 01:34:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6653498, 992594, 35086, '<td valign="top">I think it''s the first time I say this in this challenge but a tad bit overexposed perhaps, you seem to have lost many of the details in the skies.  Also, those light trails are rather distracting this in this one.  Composition needs a bit of work but it''s not bad, I like how the trees look like giants figures standing over the road.</td>', 'I think it''s the first time I say this in this challenge but a tad bit overexposed perhaps, you seem to have lost many of the details in the skies.  Also, those light trails are rather distracting this in this one.  Composition needs a bit of work but it''s not bad, I like how the trees look like giants figures standing over the road.', '2012-01-24 01:36:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6653499, 993339, 35086, '<td valign="top">I wouldn''t consider this night photography.  I''m not saying it wasn''t but the tones don''t make it seem that way.  It is a nice view and the ducks and kid on the bike is a decent addition but the fact that he''s right in the middle of the frame takes away from the picture yet again.  Also there is something very distracting around the frame, I''m not sure if that was added in but it really doesn''t work for me at all.  Very sorry.</td>', 'I wouldn''t consider this night photography.  I''m not saying it wasn''t but the tones don''t make it seem that way.  It is a nice view and the ducks and kid on the bike is a decent addition but the fact that he''s right in the middle of the frame takes away from the picture yet again.  Also there is something very distracting around the frame, I''m not sure if that was added in but it really doesn''t work for me at all.  Very sorry.', '2012-01-24 01:39:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6653501, 992690, 35086, '<td valign="top">My brain got all excited when this popped up on screen, gotta give you tons of credit for that.  I really wasn''t expecting this, very refreshing and very well captured.</td>', 'My brain got all excited when this popped up on screen, gotta give you tons of credit for that.  I really wasn''t expecting this, very refreshing and very well captured.', '2012-01-24 01:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6653503, 993394, 35086, '<td valign="top">I like how inviting this is.  :)<br/>The lights are very bright but it just makes it feel dreamy.</td>', 'I like how inviting this is.  :)The lights are very bright but it just makes it feel dreamy.', '2012-01-24 01:41:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6653505, 992951, 35086, '<td valign="top">That statue... awesome addition to an already amazing scene.  I''m curious to know what it is, tho.</td>', 'That statue... awesome addition to an already amazing scene.  I''m curious to know what it is, tho.', '2012-01-24 01:42:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6653506, 993341, 35086, '<td valign="top">Very appeasing waterscape, the moon is just amazing and I love how that structure reels you in.  Very nice shot.</td>', 'Very appeasing waterscape, the moon is just amazing and I love how that structure reels you in.  Very nice shot.', '2012-01-24 01:43:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6653508, 993306, 35086, '<td valign="top">Makes me want to be there.  :)</td>', 'Makes me want to be there.  :)', '2012-01-24 01:43:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6653509, 993401, 35086, '<td valign="top">Thia had me looking up "moon flowers".  Very cool!</td>', 'Thia had me looking up "moon flowers".  Very cool!', '2012-01-24 01:44:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6653510, 992733, 35086, '<td valign="top">The textures in the sky and tree really makes this image!  And those tones just compliment everything.  Very very nice!</td>', 'The textures in the sky and tree really makes this image!  And those tones just compliment everything.  Very very nice!', '2012-01-24 01:45:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6653511, 992867, 35086, '<td valign="top">It''s a very nice scene but the composition isn''t very strong.  I recognize that getting lower and tilting upwards might have caught those branches in the foreground which is why sometimes you gotta take some risks and go up and over for the shots.<br/> <br/>I can still picture it without ''em in front and despite the centered and flavorless composition it is still a very nice scene.</td>', 'It''s a very nice scene but the composition isn''t very strong.  I recognize that getting lower and tilting upwards might have caught those branches in the foreground which is why sometimes you gotta take some risks and go up and over for the shots. I can still picture it without ''em in front and despite the centered and flavorless composition it is still a very nice scene.', '2012-01-24 01:48:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6653512, 993391, 35086, '<td valign="top">Makes me want to get in there with a branch cutter!! XD<br/>Very nice cityscape, this is how you do a centered composition right.  The panoramic crop view works well and I''m not usually a fan of that.  I enjoyed this a lot.</td>', 'Makes me want to get in there with a branch cutter!! XDVery nice cityscape, this is how you do a centered composition right.  The panoramic crop view works well and I''m not usually a fan of that.  I enjoyed this a lot.', '2012-01-24 01:50:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6653515, 992605, 35086, '<td valign="top">I like how the clouds are moving with the long exposure, it''s just too bad you couldn''t get that effect without movement in the stars.  <br/>Very nice capture.  :)</td>', 'I like how the clouds are moving with the long exposure, it''s just too bad you couldn''t get that effect without movement in the stars.  Very nice capture.  :)', '2012-01-24 01:51:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6653518, 993418, 35086, '<td valign="top">Second shot of this Miami city shot I see tonight, almost identical color temperature as the other one.  The other person has to be your twin or something.</td>', 'Second shot of this Miami city shot I see tonight, almost identical color temperature as the other one.  The other person has to be your twin or something.', '2012-01-24 01:56:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6653520, 993392, 35086, '<td valign="top">Love the title, the composition and those stars!!  I never get to see stars like that anymore, thanks for sharing.  Giving you top scores for making my morning.  :)</td>', 'Love the title, the composition and those stars!!  I never get to see stars like that anymore, thanks for sharing.  Giving you top scores for making my morning.  :)', '2012-01-24 01:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6653521, 992577, 35086, '<td valign="top">Different and interesting shot! :)</td>', 'Different and interesting shot! :)', '2012-01-24 01:58:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6653522, 992610, 35086, '<td valign="top">In my opinion, that flash just ruined what-ever was good about this shot.</td>', 'In my opinion, that flash just ruined what-ever was good about this shot.', '2012-01-24 01:59:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6653523, 992656, 35086, '<td valign="top">Wow... is that a storm raging in?  That is an insanely powerful image!</td>', 'Wow... is that a storm raging in?  That is an insanely powerful image!', '2012-01-24 02:00:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6653524, 993428, 35086, '<td valign="top">I get that it''s abstract but I can barely make out what I''m looking at and composition is still weak.  I guess that''s what''s so hard about abstract pictures, they are extremely hard to get right.</td>', 'I get that it''s abstract but I can barely make out what I''m looking at and composition is still weak.  I guess that''s what''s so hard about abstract pictures, they are extremely hard to get right.', '2012-01-24 02:01:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6653525, 993413, 35086, '<td valign="top">I actually like this a lot but I would haven''t liked it a ton more if more of the image would have been in focus.  Aperture seem to have been too wide, I guess this is an instance where it''s much better to have a very long DOF, even if it means an even longer exposure.</td>', 'I actually like this a lot but I would haven''t liked it a ton more if more of the image would have been in focus.  Aperture seem to have been too wide, I guess this is an instance where it''s much better to have a very long DOF, even if it means an even longer exposure.', '2012-01-24 02:02:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6653526, 993323, 35086, '<td valign="top">Very peaceful image.  :)</td>', 'Very peaceful image.  :)', '2012-01-24 02:03:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6653527, 993255, 35086, '<td valign="top">That sky is just beautiful, are the the actual tones?  Love the composition and that lighthouse, the only thing is the soft focus at the top of the tower but that''s not a big issue considering how nice this is.</td>', 'That sky is just beautiful, are the the actual tones?  Love the composition and that lighthouse, the only thing is the soft focus at the top of the tower but that''s not a big issue considering how nice this is.', '2012-01-24 02:04:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6653528, 993457, 35086, '<td valign="top">Love the extra wide angle, makes it so dynamic.  I don''t mind the distortion here, it''s different and that''s good sometimes.</td>', 'Love the extra wide angle, makes it so dynamic.  I don''t mind the distortion here, it''s different and that''s good sometimes.', '2012-01-24 02:05:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6653529, 993312, 35086, '<td valign="top">Well done!  The movement of the sky adds a lot to this image.  Good contrast and composition as well.</td>', 'Well done!  The movement of the sky adds a lot to this image.  Good contrast and composition as well.', '2012-01-24 02:05:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6653531, 993414, 35086, '<td valign="top">So many stars!  I love it.</td>', 'So many stars!  I love it.', '2012-01-24 02:06:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6653532, 992382, 35086, '<td valign="top">Too bad for those overexposed lights down there that takes much of my attention away from the rest of this beautiful scene.</td>', 'Too bad for those overexposed lights down there that takes much of my attention away from the rest of this beautiful scene.', '2012-01-24 02:07:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6653533, 993356, 35086, '<td valign="top">Such a beautiful scene, you really didn''t need to have someone run in there with a light source.  It''s fun and different but I would have preferred one without that person in there.  It still is a very nice image.</td>', 'Such a beautiful scene, you really didn''t need to have someone run in there with a light source.  It''s fun and different but I would have preferred one without that person in there.  It still is a very nice image.', '2012-01-24 02:09:40.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(6653534, 993422, 35086, '<td valign="top">This image is so quiet.  It reminds me of why I like the night so much, walking around discovering places such as this one.  Beautiful image.</td>', 'This image is so quiet.  It reminds me of why I like the night so much, walking around discovering places such as this one.  Beautiful image.', '2012-01-24 02:10:46.000000', NULL, 1),
