(6653990, 993260, 138630, '<td valign="top">Not voting yet, just commenting.  I think this is a terrific scene for a nightscape and your aperture setting was apparently right on to judge by those stars.  Nice color and clarity, too.  I sure wish the horizon felt straight to me -- even if it isn''t.</td>', 'Not voting yet, just commenting.  I think this is a terrific scene for a nightscape and your aperture setting was apparently right on to judge by those stars.  Nice color and clarity, too.  I sure wish the horizon felt straight to me -- even if it isn''t.', '2012-01-24 17:27:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6654002, 993422, 120171, '<td valign="top">This is the stand out winner for me. The whole image is buttery smooth.</td>', 'This is the stand out winner for me. The whole image is buttery smooth.', '2012-01-24 18:10:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6654012, 993392, 109227, '<td valign="top">Love all the stars; really a night time landscape.  One of my top picks. (voted earlier)</td>', 'Love all the stars; really a night time landscape.  One of my top picks. (voted earlier)', '2012-01-24 18:32:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6654013, 992624, 109227, '<td valign="top">The lights give this a beautiful look, probably better than in day.  One of my top picks. (voted earlier)</td>', 'The lights give this a beautiful look, probably better than in day.  One of my top picks. (voted earlier)', '2012-01-24 18:33:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6654014, 993457, 109227, '<td valign="top">Nicely photographed and processed; looks surreal. (voted earlier)</td>', 'Nicely photographed and processed; looks surreal. (voted earlier)', '2012-01-24 18:34:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6654017, 993414, 128323, '<td valign="top">This is awesome!  Impressive that you were able to get so many stars, especially considering the city lights below the horizon.  Well done!  (voted earlier)</td>', 'This is awesome!  Impressive that you were able to get so many stars, especially considering the city lights below the horizon.  Well done!  (voted earlier)', '2012-01-24 18:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6654018, 993260, 109227, '<td valign="top">Great image for this challenge; especially like the trail in the sky on the upper left.  The tree line looks a little unlevel. (voted earlier)</td>', 'Great image for this challenge; especially like the trail in the sky on the upper left.  The tree line looks a little unlevel. (voted earlier)', '2012-01-24 18:36:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6654019, 993356, 109227, '<td valign="top">Is this person running down the hill, lol.  Great capture. (voted earlier)</td>', 'Is this person running down the hill, lol.  Great capture. (voted earlier)', '2012-01-24 18:37:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6654020, 993454, 128323, '<td valign="top">This is an amazing shot.  Love the high contrast and candid nature.  What is that in the foreground?  I can''t tell if it''s a sign or a trash can or if it''s a smudge on the lens.  I gave this a 9, would be a 10 if the foreground weren''t distracting. (voted earlier)</td>', 'This is an amazing shot.  Love the high contrast and candid nature.  What is that in the foreground?  I can''t tell if it''s a sign or a trash can or if it''s a smudge on the lens.  I gave this a 9, would be a 10 if the foreground weren''t distracting. (voted earlier)', '2012-01-24 18:38:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6654021, 993414, 109227, '<td valign="top">Nice starlight image; the white edge on the borders is a little distracting, but a lovely shot nonetheless. (voted earlier)</td>', 'Nice starlight image; the white edge on the borders is a little distracting, but a lovely shot nonetheless. (voted earlier)', '2012-01-24 18:38:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6654022, 993392, 128323, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Good tones and detail.  I like how I can still see the stars through the tree on the right.  Interesting crop too!  9 (voted earlier)</td>', 'Very nice.  Good tones and detail.  I like how I can still see the stars through the tree on the right.  Interesting crop too!  9 (voted earlier)', '2012-01-24 18:39:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6654023, 993422, 109227, '<td valign="top">I really like the blowing flags here; really sets it off.  (voted earlier)</td>', 'I really like the blowing flags here; really sets it off.  (voted earlier)', '2012-01-24 18:39:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6654024, 993341, 128323, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  I hope it doesn''t get dinged by others for not being a "night shot".  I think the star trails prove it''s at night!</td>', 'Nice shot.  I hope it doesn''t get dinged by others for not being a "night shot".  I think the star trails prove it''s at night!', '2012-01-24 18:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6654026, 992733, 128323, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  Doesn''t really look like a "night shot" though.  The detail in the clouds suggest a relatively short shutter speed.  Looks sunset-ish.  Still a beautiful shot though.  (voted earlier)</td>', 'Very nice!  Doesn''t really look like a "night shot" though.  The detail in the clouds suggest a relatively short shutter speed.  Looks sunset-ish.  Still a beautiful shot though.  (voted earlier)', '2012-01-24 18:41:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6654027, 993394, 128323, '<td valign="top">I like the warm and inviting look to this.  Nice soft tones.</td>', 'I like the warm and inviting look to this.  Nice soft tones.', '2012-01-24 18:41:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6654029, 993421, 109227, '<td valign="top">I really like this image; a little errie. It brings back memories of an old watercolor painting that belonged to my Father and now to me.(voted earlier)</td>', 'I really like this image; a little errie. It brings back memories of an old watercolor painting that belonged to my Father and now to me.(voted earlier)', '2012-01-24 18:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6654031, 993454, 109227, '<td valign="top">Terrific; love the bw; great dof. (voted earlier)</td>', 'Terrific; love the bw; great dof. (voted earlier)', '2012-01-24 18:43:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6654033, 992605, 128323, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful.  I''m curious to know where this was shot?  The star trails seem to indicate that you''re looking north, but the north star looks below the horizon.  South of the equator somewhere?</td>', 'This is beautiful.  I''m curious to know where this was shot?  The star trails seem to indicate that you''re looking north, but the north star looks below the horizon.  South of the equator somewhere?', '2012-01-24 18:43:38.000000', NULL, 1),
