(6654037, 992690, 128323, '<td valign="top">I''ve been staring at this for a while now, and this must be Dubai.  Looks like JLT on the left background and looks like it''s shot from The Montgomerie or Emirates Golf Club.  Nice clear sky and cool horizon tilt.  Well done!<br/> <br/>(voted earlier)</td>', 'I''ve been staring at this for a while now, and this must be Dubai.  Looks like JLT on the left background and looks like it''s shot from The Montgomerie or Emirates Golf Club.  Nice clear sky and cool horizon tilt.  Well done! (voted earlier)', '2012-01-24 18:47:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6654038, 993255, 63812, '<td valign="top">wonderful</td>', 'wonderful', '2012-01-24 18:47:41.000000', NULL, 1),
