(6654334, 992656, 54446, '<td valign="top">Well, congrats on your HM.  It''s a good image.  But, in the context of your other image captured about the same time, it''s not a landscape at night.  This is a DNMC and I''m embarrassed I gave it a "6".   As a photographer, you should NOT try to fool the viewer.  Good job!  But, in the light of <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=992639" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">your same time other daylight image</a>, I should have given this a "1".  You should be embarrassed, not me.</td>', 'Well, congrats on your HM.  It''s a good image.  But, in the context of your other image captured about the same time, it''s not a landscape at night.  This is a DNMC and I''m embarrassed I gave it a "6".   As a photographer, you should NOT try to fool the viewer.  Good job!  But, in the light of your same time other daylight image, I should have given this a "1".  You should be embarrassed, not me.', '2012-01-25 00:30:27.000000', NULL, 0),
