(6654363, 992690, 119863, '<td valign="top">Gave this photo a 9, thought it was going to rank much higher.  Then again, one of the top photos I gave a 3.  I really like how fresh and clean the photo is.  Barely any perceivable noise in the gradient in the sky/water, large aperture got the cityscape well in focus and a mix of warm and cold colorful lights.</td>', 'Gave this photo a 9, thought it was going to rank much higher.  Then again, one of the top photos I gave a 3.  I really like how fresh and clean the photo is.  Barely any perceivable noise in the gradient in the sky/water, large aperture got the cityscape well in focus and a mix of warm and cold colorful lights.', '2012-01-25 01:33:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(6654364, 992605, 96574, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by hahn23:</b></div><hr/><i> <br/>Good eye!  I had yours spotted as superior and excellent from the beginning. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>hehe, i knew this was gonna do really well. congrats on the well deserved ribbon richard.<br/> <br/>also, i totally agree with your mid-challenge comments on how the interesting pattern of the low votes came in.</td>', 'Originally posted by hahn23: Good eye!  I had yours spotted as superior and excellent from the beginning.   hehe, i knew this was gonna do really well. congrats on the well deserved ribbon richard. also, i totally agree with your mid-challenge comments on how the interesting pattern of the low votes came in.', '2012-01-25 01:35:47.000000', NULL, 0),
