(6654371, 992656, 137576, '<td valign="top">I gave this image a 2 as it was clearly day beautiful image but the light rays were so strong,</td>', 'I gave this image a 2 as it was clearly day beautiful image but the light rays were so strong,', '2012-01-25 01:54:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(6654373, 992733, 31409, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! I''m so sorry I missed the sunset that night, I was stuck in the optometrist''s office with my daughter at the time. I noticed the sky colour at around 3.30 pm and told the kids that there would be a great sunset!!</td>', 'Beautiful! I''m so sorry I missed the sunset that night, I was stuck in the optometrist''s office with my daughter at the time. I noticed the sky colour at around 3.30 pm and told the kids that there would be a great sunset!!', '2012-01-25 02:04:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(6654374, 993356, 137576, '<td valign="top">The person is me lighting the scene with my 15 million candle power torch, head torch trail is me coming back to find the camera as it was pitch black, needed the torch not to break my leg on the scree slopes. So the ppl who didn''t like me in the scene it would have been dark valley and bright orange sky. Winnats pass is a dramatic steep sided gorge with the Manchester to Sheffield rd in it, I drive through it everyday. So you have Manchester to the west 2m ppl Sheffield to the east 700k so lots of light pollution.</td>', 'The person is me lighting the scene with my 15 million candle power torch, head torch trail is me coming back to find the camera as it was pitch black, needed the torch not to break my leg on the scree slopes. So the ppl who didn''t like me in the scene it would have been dark valley and bright orange sky. Winnats pass is a dramatic steep sided gorge with the Manchester to Sheffield rd in it, I drive through it everyday. So you have Manchester to the west 2m ppl Sheffield to the east 700k so lots of light pollution.', '2012-01-25 02:07:14.000000', NULL, 0),
