(6654420, 992656, 109387, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by hahn23:</b></div><hr/><i> Well, congrats on your HM.  It''s a good image.  But, in the context of your other image captured about the same time, it''s not a landscape at night.  This is a DNMC and I''m embarrassed I gave it a "6".   As a photographer, you should NOT try to fool the viewer.  Good job!  But, in the light of <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=992639" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">your same time other daylight image</a>, I should have given this a "1".  You should be embarrassed, not me. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>+1<br/> <br/>All your images have camera settings listed below except this one, and there must a reason for that ;)</td>', 'Originally posted by hahn23: Well, congrats on your HM.  It''s a good image.  But, in the context of your other image captured about the same time, it''s not a landscape at night.  This is a DNMC and I''m embarrassed I gave it a "6".   As a photographer, you should NOT try to fool the viewer.  Good job!  But, in the light of your same time other daylight image, I should have given this a "1".  You should be embarrassed, not me.   +1 All your images have camera settings listed below except this one, and there must a reason for that ;)', '2012-01-25 03:33:03.000000', NULL, 0),
