(6654541, 993422, 92953, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by nutzito:</b></div><hr/><i> nice hdr (assuming this is a combination of 2 shots with different shutter speeds - one for boats, another for milky water), vignette and color processing...8 </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks Alfredo, for the help.</td>', 'Originally posted by nutzito: nice hdr (assuming this is a combination of 2 shots with different shutter speeds - one for boats, another for milky water), vignette and color processing...8   Thanks Alfredo, for the help.', '2012-01-25 07:46:07.000000', NULL, 0),
