(6654544, 993422, 92953, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by EL-ROI:</b></div><hr/><i> Definite grammar problem with the title. You used past tense then switched to present tense. But that doesn''t affect my vote. I just wanted to be a grammar nazi! For the picture. I love the brown murky water and the dark cloudy sky. It looks great with the saturated colors. The green boat, the blue tarp and the flags all pop! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thank you Ed. Pls feel free to correct my bad grammar. Sometimes I refrain from commenting just because of this.</td>', 'Originally posted by EL-ROI: Definite grammar problem with the title. You used past tense then switched to present tense. But that doesn''t affect my vote. I just wanted to be a grammar nazi! For the picture. I love the brown murky water and the dark cloudy sky. It looks great with the saturated colors. The green boat, the blue tarp and the flags all pop!   Thank you Ed. Pls feel free to correct my bad grammar. Sometimes I refrain from commenting just because of this.', '2012-01-25 07:50:33.000000', NULL, 0),
