(6654837, 993428, 38162, '<td valign="top">27" iMac - must be the gloss - its 100% black, edge to edge.  <br/> <br/>warning about abstracts in general here.  this is mostly commercial and stock folks - lots of water drops, wedding and other outtakes; tons of bucks spent on lighting and model fees.  they have zero interest in abstracts of any kind, let alone your attempt here.  so just have fun and ignore the scoring.  best of luck.</td>', '27" iMac - must be the gloss - its 100% black, edge to edge.   warning about abstracts in general here.  this is mostly commercial and stock folks - lots of water drops, wedding and other outtakes; tons of bucks spent on lighting and model fees.  they have zero interest in abstracts of any kind, let alone your attempt here.  so just have fun and ignore the scoring.  best of luck.', '2012-01-25 13:21:14.000000', NULL, 0),
