(6655209, 993256, 112972, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by scalvert:</b></div><hr/><i> With a username like that, you couldn''t do better than 10th?!? Nice Post-impressionist feel to this one. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Heh, yeah I know!  With all those 1,2,3 votes, I had no chance I guess.  Looking at the number of 10 votes and the low votes given,  It looks like most people either loved it or hated it.</td>', 'Originally posted by scalvert: With a username like that, you couldn''t do better than 10th?!? Nice Post-impressionist feel to this one.   Heh, yeah I know!  With all those 1,2,3 votes, I had no chance I guess.  Looking at the number of 10 votes and the low votes given,  It looks like most people either loved it or hated it.', '2012-01-25 22:41:47.000000', NULL, 0),
