(6655358, 992656, 123833, '<td valign="top">It is a beautiful image as you said yourself. I am very proud of it. Your score of 6 seemed very miserly. I was expecting much more. If I really like an image I give it at least a 7! But then, why should I care -  I am passed it. Whatever it takes to photograph the LIGHT ITSELF is fine with me. And it is reflected in the way I score the images of other photographers. I don''t care how they did it as long as their image captured the light for me..<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2012-01-30 16:08:33.</i></td>', 'It is a beautiful image as you said yourself. I am very proud of it. Your score of 6 seemed very miserly. I was expecting much more. If I really like an image I give it at least a 7! But then, why should I care -  I am passed it. Whatever it takes to photograph the LIGHT ITSELF is fine with me. And it is reflected in the way I score the images of other photographers. I don''t care how they did it as long as their image captured the light for me..', '2012-01-26 04:41:26.000000', '2012-01-30 16:08:33.000000', 0),
