(6657364, 993425, 142591, '<td valign="top">Thanks everyone for the nice words and an 8 from the challenge winner!Thanks Wendy,I was just happy to finish above 5 with my first entry!.I agree the shot would be better without the lights in the room showing but I wanted to show I was actually standing back from the window and didn''t just paste a window onto a black background.Bring on the challenges 2012,loving dpc!<br/></td>', 'Thanks everyone for the nice words and an 8 from the challenge winner!Thanks Wendy,I was just happy to finish above 5 with my first entry!.I agree the shot would be better without the lights in the room showing but I wanted to show I was actually standing back from the window and didn''t just paste a window onto a black background.Bring on the challenges 2012,loving dpc!', '2012-01-28 19:40:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(6657443, 993256, 43463, '<td valign="top">...and the sky full of stars. Amazing when you get away from all the light pollution of the city how many stars fill the sky. It''s a humbling experience that you are just a small part of the universe...and at the same time you are left breathless at the beauty of the heavens above. This fully captures that feel of standing outside and looking up at the heavens.</td>', '...and the sky full of stars. Amazing when you get away from all the light pollution of the city how many stars fill the sky. It''s a humbling experience that you are just a small part of the universe...and at the same time you are left breathless at the beauty of the heavens above. This fully captures that feel of standing outside and looking up at the heavens.', '2012-01-28 22:22:39.000000', NULL, 0),
