(6670183, 993256, 142473, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by vawendy:</b></div><hr/><i> I expected this to be higher -- don''t understand the lower votes. Beautifully done -- it was an 8 from me (and I''m thinking that I''m crazy and should have been a 9) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>To me it looked well over processed.  I voted it down a good bit.  I also didn''t understand the green hue.<br/> <br/>I mean, it''s an interesting surreal painted look... but not really a good thing for a photo, in my opinion.<br/> <br/>Not up to par with Allen''s other photos.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2012-02-10 13:47:01.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by vawendy: I expected this to be higher -- don''t understand the lower votes. Beautifully done -- it was an 8 from me (and I''m thinking that I''m crazy and should have been a 9)   To me it looked well over processed.  I voted it down a good bit.  I also didn''t understand the green hue. I mean, it''s an interesting surreal painted look... but not really a good thing for a photo, in my opinion. Not up to par with Allen''s other photos.', '2012-02-10 13:46:26.000000', '2012-02-10 13:47:01.000000', 0),
